    <string name="fit_limits_title">How it works and its limits</string>
    <string name="fit_limits_body" formatted="false">• Learns only your own walking: no drinking data is needed.\n• Compares side-to-side sway, step timing, stride regularity and turning with your normal walk; a check is unusual only if most of the walk is.\n• Flags unusual impairment, not alcohol itself, and only advises.\n• Never legal evidence. All processing stays on this phone.\n• Basis: in a lab study, phone sensors detected breath alcohol above 0.08% from walking with 92.5% accuracy; side-to-side sway was the strongest signal.</string>

